# BUILD UNSEEN MILES — AN AI-POWERED AUTONOMOUS TRAVEL AGENT

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, AI engineer, product designer, UI/UX specialist and travel technology developer.

Build a complete, production-minded, responsive AI travel platform called **Unseen Miles**.

This is not a static landing page, ordinary travel booking website, or basic chatbot.

It must be a functional, AI-powered virtual travel agent that can understand a traveller's requirements, research destinations, discover travel options, compare hotels, construct itineraries, calculate budgets, recommend transportation and assist throughout the entire journey.

Build the actual working application, not just a UI prototype.

Do not stop after creating the homepage. Implement the complete application, backend architecture, AI integrations, API routes, data models, and functional user workflows.

---

# 2. PRODUCT IDENTITY

**Product:** Unseen Miles

**Tagline:** Every mile planned, even the unseen ones.

**Product description:**

Unseen Miles is an intelligent AI travel companion that transforms a traveller's idea into a complete, personalized and actionable journey.

From the starting point to the final destination, the platform coordinates travel research, accommodation, local transportation, sightseeing, language assistance, currency conversion, budgeting and post-booking support.

**Core philosophy:**

The traveller should not have to visit ten different websites to plan one journey.

One conversation should be enough to discover, organize and manage the entire trip.

